# Without Adam Smith no factory row is offered (FUN_15eb_3650 raw 13707-13711).
# Start: colony_change_construction's input (France, 1599; Quebec pop 6, Lumber Mill in production).
# Fixture (sav_json): Quebec owns the Fur Trading Post (fur_traders_house bits 3 = House + Post); France
# does not own Adam Smith. Same keys as ff_adam_smith_fur_factory: the row above Lumber Mill is now
# Rum Distillery (catalog row 28), not Fur Factory.
click 168 128              # open Quebec (map tile 45,24)
wait 1
key c                      # construction picker opens on Lumber Mill
wait 1
key Up                     # one row up: Rum Distillery
wait 1
key Return                 # commit: Rum Distillery becomes Quebec's project (building_in_production 28)
wait 1
key Escape                 # back to the map
wait 1
